description: Congress.Trade coordination, branch, and production-safety rules
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md` first and treat it as the source of truth for this repo.

Cursor-owned branches use `cursor/<short-topic>` unless Jay explicitly asks for
a shared feature or integration branch. Cursor and Cursor Cloud work is peer
work alongside Codex, Claude, Copilot, and Antigravity; do not edit another
agent's branch, worktree, dirty files, or PR unless Jay explicitly asks.

Before editing, run:

```bash
git status --short --branch
git worktree list
gh pr list --state open
```

If an open PR or another worktree touches the same files, inspect changed files
and checks, then choose a disjoint slice, coordinate through a deliberate
integration branch, or stop and report the overlap.

The runnable app is in `app/`.  Production is Coolify Deno-in-Docker on
Hetzner, not a Cloudflare Worker.  Do not deploy, push, provision host or
Cloudflare resources, apply production migrations, run production scripts,
or start production backfills/ingestion unless Jay explicitly asks.

For code changes, verify from `app/` with:

```bash
npm run typecheck
npm test
```
